    "detailed_description": "A Horror Game Featuring Triggered Insaan (Nischay Malhan) as a Ghost Hunter. Explore the Environment, Find the Ghost, and Defeat Him to Escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin Triggered Insaan in his new apartment for a heart-pounding horror game! Strange things start happening, and you must help him escape using ghost-hunting tools like the EMF reader and spirit box. Investigate, solve puzzles, and survive the paranormal. Can you unravel the mystery and make it out alive?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBe careful in Triggered Insaan's spooky apartment\u2014there's a ghost around. Outsmart it to stay safe in this spooky adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGhost Hunting Tools -<br />\r\n\u2022 EMF Reader<br />\r\n\u2022 Spirit Box<br />\r\n\u2022 Summoning Circle<br />\r\n  and more...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures -<br />\r\n\u2022 High Graphics<br />\r\n\u2022 With Leaderboard<br />\r\n\u2022 Various Tools for Ghost Detection<br />\r\n\u2022 Emotes<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Mode<br />\r\n\u2022 Easy - 5 lives but unranked<br />\r\n\u2022 Hard - 1 life and Ranked",
